## Lessons

- Read bodies and tenant configuration before merging. Follow [current triage](/kb/triage/dedupe).
- Deduplicate by report ID, preserve merge history, and verify each mechanism independently.
- Received dates describe arrivals; merge dates describe desk processing. Keep those measures separate.
